  "bodyHash": "f896a902f202466e",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模組。用心打造。大量活躍於 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo 的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「你的物品很安全」是一款模組，僅使用原版方塊即可作為現有墓碑模組的替代方案。當玩家死亡時，它會防止物品消失。做法是生成一個裝備著玩家原裝備的盔甲架，以及一個裝有玩家背包物品的箱子。箱子上會放置一塊寫有玩家名稱的告示牌。如果物品太多塞不進一個箱子，會在上方自動生成另一個箱子。盔甲架會立在箱子上方。所有功能均可透過設定檔開啟或關閉。若玩家在虛空中死亡，箱子將會生成在死亡座標的正上方。<br><br>為保持遊戲平衡，只有在玩家背包中有足夠木材的情況下，箱子與盔甲架才會被生成。生成一個箱子需要消耗：2個原木、8個木板，或實際的箱子。生成盔甲架需要消耗：1個原木或3個木板。模組會優先搜尋原木，其次是木板，最後是箱子。如果找不到所需的原材料，箱子與盔甲架將<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>不會</strong></span>被生成。若您希望即使沒有原材料也一律生成，此設定同樣可在設定檔中調整。<br><br>本模組還包含生成玩家頭顱並放置在盔甲架上的功能。這能讓您更容易辨識出是哪位玩家在此處死亡。若玩家當時裝備了頭盔，頭盔會被放入箱子內。此功能預設為開啟狀態。當然，您也可以在設定檔中將其關閉。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的實用性優化包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHaveItemsInInventoryForCreation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當啟用且玩家死亡時背包內沒有任何物品，則不會生成箱子或盔甲架。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>addPlayerHeadToArmorStand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否應在盔甲架上添加玩家頭顱。若玩家戴著頭盔，頭盔將被放入箱子中。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createArmorStand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家死亡時是否生成盔甲架。若停用，玩家的裝備將直接放入箱子內。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createSignWithPlayerName</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在箱子上放置寫有該處死亡玩家名稱的告示牌。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>needChestMaterials</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">死亡生成的箱子是否需要消耗材料。可以是實際的箱子，也可以是折算的原材料成本。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>needArmorStandMaterials</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">死亡生成的盔甲架是否需要消耗材料。可以是實際的盔甲架，也可以是折算的原材料成本。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>needSignMaterials</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當 'createSignWithPlayerName' 啟用時，告示牌的生成是否需要消耗材料。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignoreStoneMaterialNeed</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">僅在 'needChestAndArmorStandMaterials' 啟用時有效。生成盔甲架需消耗1個石質階梯，但我認為忽略此需求是可以的。若啟用，死亡時背包內無需準備石材。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createChestAboveVoid</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若玩家在虛空中死亡，是否在最低建築高度正上方放置箱子。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>createVoidPlatform</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在虛空箱子的下方生成 3x3 的平台。必須先啟用 'createChestAboveVoid'。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCreationFailure</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若因缺乏材料導致箱子或盔甲架無法生成，是否發送提示訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnCreationSuccess</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">箱子與盔甲架成功生成後，是否發送提示訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendDeathCoordinatesInChat</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在聊天欄中顯示玩家死亡座標（位於失敗/成功訊息下方）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>creationFailureMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"Your items are not safe due to having insufficient materials. Missing: %plankamount% planks.\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">因材料不足導致生成失敗時發送的訊息（需啟用 'sendMessageOnCreationFailure'）。支援的替換值：%plankamount%、%stoneamount%。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>creationSuccessMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"Your items are safe at your death location.\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">成功生成後發送的訊息（需啟用 'sendMessageOnCreationSuccess'）。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"實機畫面\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死亡後生成的盔甲架與箱子：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"527\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死亡後生成兩個箱子，因為單一箱子無法容納所有物品：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"527\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死亡後生成一個箱子與一個盔甲架：</span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"530\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">上述死亡情況會產生以下結果：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此情況下玩家背包內沒有木材，因此不會生成箱子／盔甲架：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/e.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">玩家背包內有一些木板，但數量不足。系統會透過聊天訊息提示：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/f.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"532\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">背包已完全裝滿，因此需要兩個箱子來存放所有物品。幸運的是，玩家備有超過 19 個木板：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/g.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當玩家在虛空中死亡時，箱子會生成在初始位置的正上方，並伴隨一個圓石平台。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/h.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死亡座標會顯示在聊天欄中。此功能可於設定檔中關閉。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/your-items-are-safe/i.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您可自由將此模組用於任何整合包。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法同時追蹤眾多獨立模組頁面的留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>交流。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
